		(property "Note" "CLK IN (right edge, B side): from the upstream unit; connected = this unit is a clock slave. S5: unshrouded 2x5 pin header (as J8) just below the MCU strip, pin 1 at the top: the box header did not fit between the strip and the MIDI IN jack. Not keyed: plug the ribbon with its red wire on pin 1 (silk); reversed, it is harmless but the unit stays a clock master. Daisy chain: straight 10-way ribbon from a unit's CLK OUT to the next unit's CLK IN. Power-cable safe pinout (docs/research.md D10), silk \"CLK - NOT POWER\""
